> 		status = "okay";
>
> 		port@4 {
> 			reg = <4>;
>
> 			lvds0_out: endpoint {
> 				remote-endpoint = <&panel_in_lvds0>;
> 			};
> 		};
> 	};
> };


I do not see any difference, apart the display-timings in the ldb section.

